        {
            "id": "1130b9bc-8784-441f-ba0a-78929ab8f58d",
            "build_id": "34ff1acd-6c15-4ea7-a4ff-b6cd06a6465c",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:00:17.226711+00:00",
            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Blink of an Eye](item_c1f6466f-b2ac-4b6a-ba48-b1531dfd686f) is very straightforward\u2014it just reduces your Blink cooldowns a bit. Tracer usually shouldn\u2019t aim for the head unless she\u2019s very close.  \n\n[Bullet Time](item_6840382c-ae92-491a-b70c-b49f3a76003a) can feel a little weird at first, but it\u2019s solid. A 25% damage reduction against hitscan is very useful.  \n\n[Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) is also fine here since it\u2019s just one round, and not dying in a clutch situation can make the difference.  \n\n## Items\n\nIn the last round, check enemy builds and decide what\u2019s best for the situation. In most games, [El-Sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) is a strong choice, but there are plenty of alternatives. The least important upgrade here is [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2). You can keep [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and upgrade other items as well because for value it's still the best WP item.\n\n- [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48): Probably the best option if there isn\u2019t heavy armor or healing to deal with. Works well with [Underworld Quickloader](item_dc8e93b1-a561-4007-bfdc-42839f612d01), giving you 30% movement speed after a Blink, which makes you really hard to hit.  \n- [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448): Effectively 15\u201320% Weapon Power plus 10% CDR.  \n- [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27): Best versus armor, but also good in poor rounds since it\u2019s the cheapest Weapon Power per cost.  \n- [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce): Buy this if you\u2019re rich\u2014it\u2019s the most Weapon Power on paper, but also very expensive.  \n- [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121): Can save you from dying once or twice.  \n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643): Gives sustain; with [Quantum Clip](item_3a108115-ec6e-4b98-8074-1b015cf535f1) you\u2019ll sit at 25% lifesteal. Not my favorite, though, since it lowers your burst potential. \n- [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4): This replaces replaced [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) for slightly more ammo and attack speed.",
